/**
 * @page glr_procedural_rewrite_api Procedural Rewrite API
 *
 * The procedural API mirrors GRL and is documented in @ref rewrite_api.
 * Typical flow:
 *
 * - create or load a grammar
 * - load or build a @ref glr_rewrite_program_t
 * - apply it with @ref glr_rewrite_program_apply
 * - inspect @ref glr_rewrite_report_t for progress and failure status
 *
 * Direct one-shot helpers are available for all standard transforms.
 */
